show "--- Linear Regression AI Demo ---"

load data "kids_data.csv" as df
show "Here is the kids data:"
show data df 5 rows

show "Making a Linear Regression AI..."
make AI "linear" as my_ai

show "Teaching the AI to guess the 'weight' of a kid using their data..."
teach my_ai using df to guess "weight"

show "Testing the AI on the same data..."
test my_ai on df as score metric "rmse"

show "The Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE) on weight is:"
show score
